.workbuddy/
.DS_Store
# Documentation is private by default. Only reviewed, reusable documents are
# explicitly allowlisted for version control; local reports and environment
# walkthroughs may contain internal addresses, usernames, or machine paths.
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/api.md
!docs/authorization.md
!docs/mcp.md
# Diátaxis 文档体系：教程 / 操作指南 / 参考 / 解释
!docs/quickstart.md
!docs/concepts.md
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/guides.md
!docs/reference.md
!docs/troubleshooting.md
